PolynomialRing_generic.gens_dict.example:
sage: R.<x> = QQ[]
sage: R.gens_dict()
{'x': x}

CategoryObject.gens_dict.example:
sage: GF(7).gens_dict()
{'1': 1}
sage: F = GF(2^8, modulus=x^8 + x^4 + x^3 + x + 1, names=("a",))
sage: F.gens_dict()
{'a': a}

CategoryObject.gens_dict_recursive.example:
sage: ZZ["x"]["y"].gens_dict_recursive()
{'x': x, 'y': y}
sage: F = GF(2^8, modulus=x^8 + x^4 + x^3 + x + 1, names=("a",))
sage: F.gens_dict_recursive()
{'a': a}
